#: adddevicedialog.cpp:58
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If your scanner has not been automatically detected, you can specify it "
"here. The <interface>Scanner device</interface> is the SANE backend device "
"name. The <interface>Manufacturer</interface>, <interface>Type</interface> "
"and <interface>Description</interface> can be used to identify the scanner "
"later.<nl/><nl/>More information on <link url=\"?1\">SANE backends</link>, "
"<link url=\"?2\">locating devices</link>, <link url=\"?3\">HP scanners</"
"link>, <link url=\"?4\">device not found</link>."
msgstr "Ako vaš skener nije automatski otkriven, možete ga ovdje navesti. <interface>Uređaj skenera</interface> naziv je uređaja SANE pozadinskog sustava. <interface>Proizvođač</interface>, <interface>Vrsta</interface> i <interface>Opis</interface> mogu poslužiti za kasnije prepoznavanje skenera.<nl/><nl/>Više informacija o <link url=\"?1\">SANE pozadinskim sustavima</link>, <link url=\"?2\">pronalaženju uređaja</link>, <link url=\"?3\">HP skenerima</link> i <link url=\"?4\">nepronađenim uređajima</link>."

