#: adddevicedialog.cpp:126
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The <interface>Scanner device</interface> should be a backend name (with "
"optional parameters) that is understood by SANE. See <link url=\"man:/sane"
"\">sane(7)</link> or <link url=\"man:/sane-dll\">sane&#8209;dll(5)</link> "
"for more information on available backends and the format of device names."
msgstr "<interface>Uređaj skenera</interface> treba biti naziv pozadinskog sustava (s neobaveznim parametrima) koji razumije SANE. Više informacija o dostupnim pozadinskim sustavima i obliku naziva uređaja potražite u priručnicima <link url=\"man:/sane\">sane(7)</link> ili <link url=\"man:/sane-dll\">sane&#8209;dll(5)</link>."

#: adddevicedialog.cpp:134
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"To find the information that needs to be entered here, try to locate the "
"device using the <link url=\"man:/sane-find-scanner\">sane&#8209;find&#8209;"
"scanner(1)</link> command for SCSI, USB or parallel port scanners, or the "
"<link url=\"man:/scanimage\">scanimage(1)</link> command with the "
"<icode>&#8209;L</icode> option for network scanners. If the scanner is "
"found, then enter the device name displayed by these commands."
msgstr "Da biste pronašli podatke koje ovdje treba unijeti, pokušajte pronaći uređaj naredbom <link url=\"man:/sane-find-scanner\">sane&#8209;find&#8209;scanner(1)</link> za SCSI, USB ili paralelne skenere ili naredbom <link url=\"man:/scanimage\">scanimage(1)</link> s mogućnošću <icode>&#8209;L</icode> za mrežne skenere. Ako je skener pronađen, unesite naziv uređaja koji prikazuju te naredbe."

#: adddevicedialog.cpp:143
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"For a USB or networked HP scanner using <link url=\"http://hplip.sourceforge."
"net/\">HPLIP</link>, try using the <command>hp&#8209;probe</command> command "
"to locate it, for example <icode>hp&#8209;probe&nbsp;&#8209;b&nbsp;usb</"
"icode> or <icode>hp&#8209;probe&nbsp;&#8209;b&nbsp;net</icode>. Note that if "
"the scanner is found by HPLIP, then the device name <icode>hp:</icode> that "
"it displays needs to be replaced by <icode>hpaio:</icode> for SANE."
msgstr "Za HP skener povezan putem USB-a ili mreže koji koristi <link url=\"http://hplip.sourceforge.net/\">HPLIP</link>, pokušajte ga pronaći naredbom <command>hp&#8209;probe</command>, primjerice <icode>hp&#8209;probe&nbsp;&#8209;b&nbsp;usb</icode> ili <icode>hp&#8209;probe&nbsp;&#8209;b&nbsp;net</icode>. Ako HPLIP pronađe skener, njegov naziv uređaja <icode>hp:</icode> potrebno je zamijeniti s <icode>hpaio:</icode> za SANE."

#: adddevicedialog.cpp:152
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If these commands fail to locate your scanner, then it may not be supported "
"by SANE. Check the SANE documentation for a <link url=\"http://www.sane-"
"project.org/sane-supported-devices.html\">list of supported devices</link>."
msgstr "Ako ove naredbe ne mogu pronaći vaš skener, SANE ga možda ne podržava. Popis podržanih uređaja potražite u dokumentaciji SANE-a na <link url=\"http://www.sane-project.org/sane-supported-devices.html\">ovoj stranici</link>."

